#: ../../source/docs/loiter-to-qland-mode.rst:5
#: 0c31d1a9e49149b4aa28b85210753cb5
msgid "LOITER to Altitude and QLAND Mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-to-qland-mode.rst:7
#: 7de4f8f6190b47ae9b0b5652faf0873c
msgid "If the previous mode was a fixed wing mode, this mode will perform a descending fixed wing LOITER down to :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` and then switch to :ref:`QLAND mode <qland-mode>`. If the aircraft was already performing a loiter when switching to this mode the LOITER center does not change, otherwise the LOITER center will become the same location it is at when entering the mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-to-qland-mode.rst:9
#: cd42b1f15e2a4360876e18733ade977c
msgid "the QLAND target will be directly below the point it switches to QLAND (ie on the loiter circle path, not its center)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-to-qland-mode.rst:11
#: e1afb74c48294112989fe05ceb0bee2a
msgid "If in a VTOL mode, or below  :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`, when switching to this mode, it will change immediately to :ref:`QLAND mode <qland-mode>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-to-qland-mode.rst:13
#: 51e2294f7ac54c7f87d1a62b5bad3dce
msgid "This is useful as a Battery Failsafe action to VTOL land the vehicle with as little battery usage as possible if at higher altitudes than using :ref:`QLAND mode <qland-mode>` by itself."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-to-qland-mode.rst:15
#: 1857d9f1a87042fdbc0c5aef82924f07
msgid "The fixed wing loiter radius is set by :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` and descent rate is :ref:`FBWB_CLIMB_RATE<FBWB_CLIMB_RATE>` until :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` is reached, and when reached, it will switch to :ref:`QLAND mode <qland-mode>`."
msgstr ""
